    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d598">

                <pb facs="0783" n="689" xml:id="pg689"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Sebastian</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-10-10"><hi rendition="#italic">October 10,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister for foreign affairs promises relief in every ease of contract made
                    before decree prohibiting shipment. Will also telegraph Cuba urging
                    noninterference in all cases where it is clear that contract was made before
                    decree.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Taylor</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
